  "ruleText": "Env-A 1502.02 Federal Definitions Incorporated. Except as specified in Env-A 1502.03 or Env-A 1504.03, the definitions contained in and referred to in 40 CFR §93.101 shall apply to the terms used in this chapter.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1500) #9999, eff 10-1-11; ss by #12975, eff 1-18-20",
